     ccaall prints a calendar.  With no arguments, it prints a
     calendar for the current month.

     With one argument: if the argument is numeric it is taken as
     a _y_e_a_r and ccaall prints a twelve-month calendar for that year;
     otherwise the argument is taken as a _m_o_n_t_h and ccaall prints
     that month of the current year.

